# Direct dependencies for reference/sparse_spike.py (Feature 012: the sparse-expansion spike).
#
# torch / transformers / tokenizers / safetensors / numpy are Feature 004's pins
# (reference/requirements-004.in) — the same builds that mint the dense goldens, so the two
# reference stacks agree. pytrec_eval is Feature 003's scorer pin: the spike imports
# reference/gen_003_fixtures.py and scores every run through it. scipy holds the CSR matrices
# for the dot product and the BM25-over-expansions variant; snowballstemmer approximates the
# engine's `standard_en` for the spike's own text BM25 (research D5); huggingface-hub only
# pins models (`sparse_spike.py pin`).
torch==2.14.0
transformers==5.17.0
tokenizers==0.23.2
safetensors==0.8.0
numpy==2.5.3
pytrec_eval==0.5
scipy
snowballstemmer
